# "Whenever this Vehicle enters or attacks, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle." Bot1 casts
# Lumbering Worldwagon with a Black Lotus, accepts, and finds a Forest (the nonbasic Karakas is in the library but not offered: only a basic land card may be
# found - the Search refusal; a basic Mountain is the positive control, offered though not a Forest). The Forest arrives tapped (the one played
# earlier is untapped, so it is the found one that is tapped). Its power is read in the attack scenario, where it is a creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Lumbering Worldwagon
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Mountain
Karakas
Forest x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Lumbering Worldwagon.Cast
? Stack = Lumbering Worldwagon
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Search(Karakas)
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Lumbering Worldwagon
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Tapped = true
Bot1.Library.Count = 9
